  "body": "Add a clean-room 2-axis wire EDM post (`assets/posts/g-edm.cps`) for G-EDM / `G-RBLv3` controllers.\n\n## Context\n\n`assets/posts/wire-iso.cps` requires `edm.codes.condition` (with `{id}`) and `edm.codes.comp_off`, and it writes `%` tape fences. Public G-EDM documentation (`gedm.org`, `github.com/G-EDM/G-RBL`) states that DIY G-EDM builds control spark power at the controller or firmware instead of via G-code condition words, and `Grbl_Esp32` / Grbl v1.1 rejects bare `%` fences (`error:20`) and `G41`/`G42` radius compensation.\n\n## What this does\n\n- Add `assets/posts/g-edm.cps` (`vendor = \"Camcraft\"`, `wireEdm = true`, `afterModes = true`, `programUnits = \"mm inch\"`), with provenance citing public `gedm.org` and `Grbl_Esp32` documentation. Read no `G-RBLv3` source code.\n- Register `\"G-EDM Wire EDM\"` in `crates/app/src/posting.rs` (`WIRE_POSTS`) and `crates/app/src/posting_files.rs` (`BUILTINS` and `embedded()`). Keep `\"Generic ISO Wire EDM\"` as the default (`WIRE_POSTS[0]`).\n- Write `(NOT VERIFIED ON A CONTROL - CHECK BEFORE CUTTING)` and condition reminders as `(...)` header comments. Do not require `edm.codes`.\n- Emit `G21`/`G20`, `G90`, `G17`, `G0`, `G1`, `G2`/`G3` (`I`/`J`), and `M30`, with no `%` fence, no `O`-word, and no `G41`/`G42`.\n- Refuse non-`wire_edm` machines, rotaries, `Z` changes, `WireTaper != 0`, `WireFourAxis`, `WireU`/`WireV`, `WireAngle`, `onRadiusCompensation`, `skims`, `onCycle`, `onToolChange`, `SpindleSpeed > 0`, and `AfterOperation === \"home\"` by name.\n- Check `#2697` before coding for any new `G-RBLv3` answers from the reporter (for example whether `G1` requires a dummy `F` word to avoid Grbl `error:22`, `G40`, `M00` threading pauses, or a return move to origin).\n- Add golden and refusal tests (`crates/app/tests/g_edm_post.rs`, `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/g-edm/`, `crates/post/tests/script_g_edm.rs`, `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/g-edm/`), and update `crates/app/tests/conformance.rs` (`WIRE_POSTS` and `EXTENSIONS`).\n\n## Done means:\n\n- `\"G-EDM Wire EDM\"` posts a 2-axis `WireContour` golden without `edm.codes` through `posting::post_script`.\n- Non-`wire_edm` machines, `G41`/`G42`, taper, 4-axis, skims, and mill goldens refuse by name.\n- `cargo xtask gate test g_edm --crate camcraft-app`, `cargo xtask gate test conformance --crate camcraft-app`, and `cargo xtask gate test script_g_edm --crate camcraft-post` pass.\n\nPart of #2697\n",
